flowchart LR
  UI[Cliente / Frontend]
  API["portafolio-cv-api (Function App)"]
  HASH[Hash + cache en Cosmos]
  QUEUE[Storage Queue cv-requests]
  WORKER["portafolio-cv-worker (Function App)"]
  PDF[Blob Storage container pdfs]
  META[Cosmos DB metadata]
  NOTIF["portafolio-notifier (Function App)"]
  EMAIL[Proveedor email / CRM]

  UI -->|POST solicitud| API
  API -->|verifica cache| HASH
  HASH -->|hit -> responde| UI
  HASH -->|miss| QUEUE
  API -->|enqueue JSON| QUEUE

  QUEUE -->|trigger| WORKER
  WORKER -->|genera PDF privado| PDF
  WORKER -->|estado/ids| META
  WORKER -->|notifica| NOTIF

  NOTIF -->|arma correo con SAS| EMAIL
  NOTIF -->|actualiza estado| META
  EMAIL --> UI
